# Files and folders the style tools (banner_formatter.py, function_list_generator.py)
# skip. One pattern per line, like .gitignore: end a folder with /, * is a wildcard.
# Always skipped: .git, .venv, venv, build, style, __pycache__, logs (and hidden
# folders for the function list).
#
# Examples (remove the # to use them):
# lib/
# vendor/
# generated_*.py
